title: Shadow Investigation
subtitle: Dig into the hidden currents behind the Republic's crises.
is-card: true
tags: caucus_affairs
card-image: img/card_shadow.svg
view-if: investigate_timer <= 0 and date >= 12 and cardok_investigate
on-arrival: turn_actions += 1; investigate_timer = 2; last_card_timer = "investigate"; investigated_at = time
new-page: true

= Shadow Investigation

Too many of the Republic's crises seem to serve someone. Our evidence is **[+ evidence : evidence +]**. Investigations carry risks: the people behind these events do not like being looked at.

[? if investigators_lost > 0 : *We have already lost [+ investigators_lost +] investigator(s).* ?]

- @money: Follow the money.
- @slicer: Hire a slicer to break into sealed records.
- @share: Share our findings with the Jedi Council.
- @archives: Pursue the gap in the Jedi Archives.
- @charges: Lay charges before the Senate.
- @records: Comb through public records.
- @easy_discard

@money
subtitle: −1 political capital. Slow but fairly safe.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {!
Q.capital -= 1;
var gain = 0.35 + (Q.tf_probe ? 0.15 : 0) + (Q.chair_finance === 'rc' ? 0.25 : 0) + (Q.banking_audit ? 0.2 : 0);
Q.evidence += gain;
Q.inv_result = 'The trail leads through shell companies, a Muunilinst bank and a dead Muun financier\'s holding company, Damask Holdings.';
if (Math.random() < 0.08 + Q.grand_plan / 600) { Q.leak_pending = 1; Q.inv_result += ' Someone noticed us looking.'; }
!}

[+ inv_result +]

@slicer
subtitle: −2 political capital. Faster, but riskier.
choose-if: capital >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 2 political capital.
on-arrival: {!
Q.capital -= 2;
Q.evidence += 0.8 + (Q.chair_judiciary === 'rc' ? 0.3 : 0);
Q.inv_result = 'Our slicer cracks a sealed archive of Chancellery correspondence. Most of it is dull. A little of it is chilling.';
if (Math.random() < 0.2 + Q.grand_plan / 400) { Q.leak_pending = 1; Q.inv_result += ' Then the slicer stops answering her comlink.'; }
!}

[+ inv_result +]

@share
view-if: evidence >= 2
subtitle: The Jedi grow more suspicious, and closer to us.
on-arrival: jedi_suspicion += 1; jedi_relation += 2; evidence += 0.2

Master Windu reads our dossier in silence. "This is not proof," he says at last. "But it is not nothing."

@archives
view-if: archive_gap_known and not kamino_known
subtitle: −1 political capital. Someone erased a star system from the Archives.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; kamino_hunt += 1; evidence += 0.3

Our people work through old hyperspace charts, cargo manifests and the travel logs of a dead Jedi Master named Sifo-Dyas. [? if kamino_hunt >= 2 : The gap is closing. One more push and we will find the missing world. ?]

@charges
view-if: evidence >= 7 and not sidious_known and not finale
subtitle: [? if evidence >= 10 : Our case is conclusive. This is the moment. ?][? if evidence < 10 : Our case is strong but not conclusive. If it fails, the Caucus may not survive. ?]
choose-if: capital >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 2 political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 2
go-to: fin_charges

@records
subtitle: Free. Slow, safe work.
on-arrival: evidence += 0.15

Caucus researchers read shipping registries and committee minutes until their eyes ache. Now and then something does not add up.
